A skill slot is a skill's contract and workspace template. The content that briefs
an agent for a slot (a skill's SKILL.md and references/) is not part of this
repository, except for the four free skills: architect-skill-orchestrator,
adr-authoring, agent-workflow-design and arch-review-task.

Skill content bought separately is licensed by its seller under its own terms
(personal licence, no redistribution). Installing it with `skills install` copies it
into your own folder (~/.architect-framework/exported_skills/); the framework never
copies it into a workspace, a ledger, a log or a checkpoint, and records only its
SHA-256 in a page's provenance.
